&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Verdana&#39; sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The Enterprise Service Desk Engineer supports and maintains a multi-tenant hosted infrastructure, acting as an escalation point for complex technical issues. The role includes administration of Citrix, VMware, Microsoft server and messaging platforms, proactive monitoring, and vendor coordination. This position works closely with support teams and provides periodic out-of-hours escalation support to ensure platform stability and service continuity.&lt;br&gt;This job description sets out the general nature and main duties of the role and is not an exhaustive list. The post-holder may be asked to undertake other duties of a similar nature and level that are reasonably required. ABACUS may update this job description from time to time to reflect changing business needs and will consult with the post-holder before making any significant changes. This job description does not form part of the contract of employment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
