&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to escalated issues from CSE and Remote Support teams in a timely fashion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership and follow up of pending issues to resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of Multi-tenant hosted Citrix platform in a team based environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond and action alerts from centralized management system to maintain health of platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of VMware virtualized environment in a team-based environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of Multi-tenant hosted Exchange platform in a team based environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management and maintenance of physical datacenter resources.&lt;/li&gt;
