&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Abacus’s Level Three Support - Engineer role is responsible for the design and implementation of customer-facing and internal systems, including public and private cloud environments as well as on-premise infrastructure and telephony systems, all while providing a world-class client experience daily. In addition to leading projects, Level Threes provide escalation support to all service delivery team members.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
