&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Windows domain administration and troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft 365, including Teams, Exchange, Intune, SharePoint, Azure Cloud, and Azure AD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Storage Area Networks (Nimble, Pure Storage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public cloud platforms (Azure and AWS)&lt;/li&gt;
