&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attributes that will drive success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clients view the engineer as a trusted resource&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
