&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Senior Network Engineer, you will bring your expertise with Cisco, Juniper, and next generation firewall technologies to the position. You will manage performance and availability of Abacus datacentre networks across the US and UK and participate in improvement projects. You will be part of a team tasked with maintaining a very level of availability and performance for datacentre services. You will also be a point of escalation for support incidents that affect multiple clients. Further, you will serve as a technical lead for internal and client projects, participating in client network builds.&lt;/div&gt;
