&lt;div&gt;Diagnose and resolve complex issues quickly, proactively identify areas for improvement, and recommend solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support and maintain network backbone infrastructure involving multiple datacenters and geographic regions based on dynamic routing protocols (OSPF, BGP), and various mediums (DIA, PTP, VPN, multi-gig connectivity,&lt;/div&gt;
