&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc13&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;This position is ideal for someone who enjoys blending technical expertise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc14&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;with customer engagement and wants to contribute to product quality and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc15&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc16&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc18&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Provide Level 2 and Level 3 technical support for enterprise software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc19&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc21&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot application, database, API, and integration issues using &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc22&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;logs, diagnostic tools, and monitoring platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc24&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Analyze customer-reported issues, reproduce defects, identify root &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc25&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;causes, and recommend solutions or workarounds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc27&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Manage incidents and service requests in accordance with established &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc28&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Service Level Agreements (SLAs).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc30&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Escalate complex software defects to Engineering while providing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc31&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;detailed technical analysis and documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc33&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Development, QA, Product Management, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc34&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;DevOps teams to resolve production issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc36&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Monitor application health and proactively identify recurring issues or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc37&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;trends.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc39&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Document troubleshooting procedures, knowledge base articles, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc40&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;standard operating procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc42&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Support software deployments, upgrades, patches, and release &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc43&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;validation activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc45&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Assist customers with application configuration, user access, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc46&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;integrations, and system functionality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc48&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Participate in on-call support rotation as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc50&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement initiatives that enhance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc51&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;product stability, support processes, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science, or a related field preferred, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in a systems administration/ helpdesk role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years of experience in an software development role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to possible weekend work and possible on-call schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Benefits of Working for Abacus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to a diverse array of technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Part of a team of experienced technicians that aim to deliver exceptional service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robust benefits package: medical, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401k, and PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to further technical education through online courses&lt;/li&gt;
